      "content": "idk... i feel like i've already tried all that. talking doesn't change the fact that i'm just empty. there's nothing left to fix. it's like i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. even when i'm sleeping, i'm not really resting. it's just a constant, heavy weight. it feels like the world is just too much to keep up with anymore.",
